FAST-LIVO2 reproduction — attribution and modification notice
============================================================

This repository is an independent reproduction and verification project around
FAST-LIVO2. It contains a patched ROS2 port, the harness used to run and score
the system, and documentation. It is not an official release of FAST-LIVO2.

